# Root gitignore: repo-wide build/test output. web/ has its own
# web/.gitignore for the console toolchain.

# goreleaser output, anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `dist/`
# would also match internal/rest/static/dist (the console embed dir)
# and silently ignore newly generated bundle files.
/dist/

# Console embed bundle: internal/rest/static/dist is rebuilt from source
# via `bun run build:embed` in web/ (pinned bun in the web job and the
# release/nightly publish jobs). Ignore the generated bundle so Go-only
# checkouts never see bundle churn; only the placeholder.txt that keeps
# `go:embed` compiling on checkouts without the bundle is tracked.
/internal/rest/static/dist/*
!/internal/rest/static/dist/placeholder.txt

# Go build/test byproducts
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
